  "bodyHash": "0abfe8f568b189a2",
  "content": "\n\n<p>(<strong>开发中</strong>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>Delta的多功能工具</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#fff\">本模组添加了多功能工具，无需依赖<strong>Mekanism Tools</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">（也是</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">“<strong>Bog's Multitools</strong>”</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">的重制版）</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#fff\">本模组添加了：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#fff\">&nbsp;原版斧镐（木头、石头、铁、金、钻石和下界合金）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#fff\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">紫金</span>！（锭、护甲、斧镐、音乐唱片和新方块！）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;color:#fff\">本模组&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>可</strong></span>&nbsp;用于整合包。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
